  Slug: feybound
  DisplayName: Feybound
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You have spent time in the First World or another realm of the fey
    and aren't entirely the same person you were before. Perhaps you made a purchase
    at the legendary Witchmarket or partook deeply of fey food and wine. Whatever
    the case, willingly or inadvertently, you made a bargain with the fey, the benefits
    of which come at a price. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity
    or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You are trained in Fey Lore
    and gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Fey's Fortune] free action.
    You must follow some rule or limitation as part of your pact with the fey. If
    you violate the rule, you lose Fey's Fortune until you receive the effects of
    a successful @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Atone] ritual using the Nature
    skill. The exact limitation is up to you and the GM, but the most common requirement
    is that you must fulfill a single request from any fey who knows your name.
